### metricsink HTTP 请求样例
### 时间参数支持 Unix 秒或 RFC3339；标签过滤用 label.<name>=<value>。
### 假设服务运行在 http://127.0.0.1:8080

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 健康检查
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/healthz

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1) 摄入原始样本（批量）
###    返回 inserted/revised/duplicate/rejected 计数。
###    - 同 id 再次写入但值/时间不同 => revised（迟到修订）
###    - 同 id 且内容完全相同        => duplicate（幂等）
###    - 非法样本（缺 metric、NaN/Inf）进入 rejected，其余照常写入
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "samples": [
    {"id": "s-1", "metric": "cpu.usage", "labels": {"host": "host-a", "zone": "z1"}, "ts": 1735693200, "value": 51.2},
    {"id": "s-2", "metric": "cpu.usage", "labels": {"host": "host-a", "zone": "z1"}, "ts": 1735693205, "value": 53.8},
    {"id": "s-3", "metric": "cpu.usage", "labels": {"host": "host-a", "zone": "z1"}, "ts": 1735693260, "value": 48.0}
  ]
}

### 迟到修订：同一个 id，修正数值（也可改 ts / labels，修订会跨桶跨序列传播）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "samples": [
    {"id": "s-1", "metric": "cpu.usage", "labels": {"host": "host-a", "zone": "z1"}, "ts": 1735693200, "value": 500.0}
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2) 查询原始样本（step=raw）
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/query?metric=cpu.usage&label.host=host-a&start=2025-01-01T01:00:00Z&end=2025-01-01T01:01:59Z&step=raw

### 分钟层（step=60 或 1m）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/query?metric=cpu.usage&label.host=host-a&start=2025-01-01T01:00:00Z&end=2025-01-01T01:59:59Z&step=60

### 小时层（step=3600 或 1h）；fill=zero 用 count=0 显式补齐空桶
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/query?metric=cpu.usage&label.host=host-a&start=2025-01-01T01:00:00Z&end=2025-01-01T03:59:59Z&step=1h&fill=zero

### 自动选层（span<=2h 用分钟层，否则小时层）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/query?metric=cpu.usage&start=1735693200&end=1735703999&step=auto

### 对账：忽略存储层，直接从保留的原始样本重算（同样输出 count/sum/min/max）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/query?metric=cpu.usage&label.host=host-a&start=2025-01-01T01:00:00Z&end=2025-01-01T03:59:59Z&step=1h&fill=zero&source=recompute

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3) 列出序列（支持标签等值过滤）
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/series?metric=cpu.usage
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/series?metric=cpu.usage&label.zone=z1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4) 删除样本（显式订正）：从分钟/小时层传播移除效果
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{"ids": ["s-2", "not-there"]}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5) 原始保留窗口驱逐（有损压缩）：删除早于 before 的原始样本，
###    分钟/小时聚合保留；被驱逐 id 永久不可修订/复用。
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/evict
Content-Type: application/json

{"before": "2025-01-01T02:00:00Z"}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6) 立即落快照（默认进程退出时也会落；另有自动快照周期）
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/snapshot
